80 polymer     nat tRNA                                                                                      24468.551   2   ? ? ? 
;One molecule is found in the A-site, and one molecule is found in the P-site. No specific tRNAs are represented in the peptidyltransferase centers of polysomal ribosomes. Therefore, we adapted the tRNA model for a eukaryotic ICG-anticodon tRNA that decodes Arg codons (PDB ID: 6T4Q) to model the tRNA densities of both A- and P-site tRNAs.
;
81 polymer     nat 'Nascent peptide'                                                                         358.434     1   ? ? ? 
;No specific nascent peptide is represented in the polysomal ribosomes. Therefore, we used UNK (unknown residue) to represent each residue of the nascent peptide.
;
82 polymer     nat mRNA                                                                                      5159.861    1   ? ? ? 
'No specific mRNA is represented in the polysomal ribosomes. Therefore, we used Uracil to model the mRNA.' 
